cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Open-BEATBox in published work, please cite it as below."
title: "Open-BEATBox website"
type: software
abstract: "Open-BEATBox (Open - BEhavioural and AuTonomous operant Box) is an open-source, modular, low-cost platform for autonomous home-cage operant conditioning and long-duration behavioural data acquisition in rodents. This repository holds the Open-BEATBox website and documentation build pipeline."
